{"id":"conv_03607","context":"Teacher discusses college recommendation letters with a student","ambient":"lecture_hall_quiet","cast":["asuka_teacher","ren_uni"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Sensei, I came to ask if you could write me a recommendation letter.","jp":"先生、推薦状をお願いしたくて来ました。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[4,5,8,14,19,28,62,228,392,501,779,2473,4401,4781,7385],"jpTokens":[{"s":"先生","r":"せんせい","w":228},{"s":"、"},{"s":"推薦","r":"すいせん","w":4401},{"s":"状","r":"じょう","w":2473},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"お願い","r":"おねがい","w":392},{"s":"し","w":19},{"s":"たく","w":62},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"来","r":"き","w":779},{"s":"まし","w":14},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"asuka_teacher","mood":null,"en":"Of course I'll write one. First, can you tell me your motivation for applying?","jp":"もちろん書きますよ。まず志望動機を聞かせてくれる?","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[4,5,14,68,186,245,335,370,418,632,1017,1414,4326,4487,8712,18099],"jpTokens":[{"s":"もちろん","w":335},{"s":"書き","r":"かき","w":632},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"},{"s":"まず","w":370},{"s":"志望","r":"しぼう","w":8712},{"s":"動機","r":"どうき","w":4326},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"聞か","r":"きか","w":1017},{"s":"せ","w":245},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"くれる","w":418},{"s":"?"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Yes. My aim in studying abroad is to broaden my field of expertise.","jp":"はい。留学の狙いは、自分の専門を広げることです。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,3,5,15,17,74,526,2100,2174,2282,3887,4357,7335],"jpTokens":[{"s":"はい","w":2100},{"s":"。"},{"s":"留学","r":"りゅうがく","w":2282},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"狙い","r":"ねらい","w":4357},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"、"},{"s":"自分","r":"じぶん","w":74},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"専門","r":"せんもん","w":526},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"広げる","r":"ひろげる","w":7335},{"s":"こと","w":15},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"asuka_teacher","mood":null,"en":"Good. Then let's organize the main points of your essay into about three.","jp":"いいね。じゃあエッセイの論点を三つくらいに整理しようか。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,5,16,19,29,51,81,226,324,1354,2544,3425,3862,3979,4648,5014,7017,7178,9528,17897],"jpTokens":[{"s":"いい","w":81},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"。"},{"s":"じゃあ","w":2544},{"s":"エッセイ","w":3979},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"論点","r":"ろんてん","w":4648},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"三つ","r":"みっつ","w":3425},{"s":"くらい","w":226},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"整理","r":"せいり","w":1354},{"s":"しよ","w":19},{"s":"う","w":29},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Honestly, preparing to study abroad feels like training, it's tough every day.","jp":"正直、留学準備は修行みたいで、毎日つらいです。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[3,17,21,439,622,818,1578,2282,4456,4969,7178,10195],"jpTokens":[{"s":"正直","r":"しょうじき","w":1578},{"s":"、"},{"s":"留学","r":"りゅうがく","w":2282},{"s":"準備","r":"じゅんび","w":818},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"修行","r":"しゅぎょう","w":4456},{"s":"みたい","w":439},{"s":"で","w":21},{"s":"、"},{"s":"毎日","r":"まいにち","w":622},{"s":"つらい","w":4969},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"asuka_teacher","mood":null,"en":"Feeling that strain is a healthy sign. You'll grow used to it gradually.","jp":"つらいのは健全な証拠だよ。少しずつ慣れていけば大丈夫。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,3,4,21,41,68,138,259,331,1438,1529,1919,2573,4276,4969,7178,7885,10195,10219],"jpTokens":[{"s":"つらい","w":4969},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"健全","r":"けんぜん","w":4276},{"s":"な","w":21},{"s":"証拠","r":"しょうこ","w":1919},{"s":"だ","w":21},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"},{"s":"少し","r":"すこし","w":259},{"s":"ずつ","w":1438},{"s":"慣れ","r":"なれ","w":10219},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"いけ","w":138},{"s":"ば","w":41},{"s":"大丈夫","r":"だいじょうぶ","w":1529},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"I heard debates over there are very active, and I worry I can't keep up.","jp":"向こうでは議論が活発だと聞いて、ついていけるか不安です。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[3,4,6,7,9,16,17,21,296,331,516,1017,1061,1985,2569,3181,4451,7885,9154],"jpTokens":[{"s":"向こう","r":"むこう","w":2569},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"議論","r":"ぎろん","w":516},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"活発